  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:aneni_beemet_yishekha">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:aneni_beemet_yishekha/1"/>answer me,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:aneni_beemet_yishekha/2"/>with the truth of Your deliverance.<tei:anchor xml:id="note_1"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase"/>
<tei:note type="instruction" xml:lang="en">When the Holy Ark is opened, the following is said:</tei:note>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:aneni_beemet_yishekha/3"/>Whenever the Ark traveled,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:aneni_beemet_yishekha/4"/>Moses would say: “Rise, Adonoy
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:aneni_beemet_yishekha/5"/>and let Your enemies be scattered,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:aneni_beemet_yishekha/6"/>and those who hate You flee before You.”
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:aneni_beemet_yishekha/7"/>For from Zion will go forth the Torah,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:aneni_beemet_yishekha/8"/>and the word of Adonoy from Jerusalem.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:aneni_beemet_yishekha/9"/>Blessed is He Who gave the Torah
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:aneni_beemet_yishekha/10"/>to His people Israel in His holiness.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
  </tei:text>
  <tei:standOff type="notes">
    <tei:note type="commentary" target="#note_1" xml:lang="en">
      <tei:p>Psalms 69:14.</tei:p>
